Subject: [PATCH] chore(devcontainer): default port-forward to ignore +
 document opt-in
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VS Code's otherPortsAttributes is now set to "ignore" in
devcontainer.json — processes listening inside the container no
longer silently expose themselves to the host. Ports appear under
"Not Forwarded" in the Ports panel and are forwarded manually
(right-click → Forward Port) or by adding a portsAttributes entry
with onAutoForward="silent" / "notify". A new "Port forwarding
(dev servers)" section in README.md walks through the opt-in flow
with a wtf + Vite dev-server example.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
